message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper."
title: "Two Buttons, One Feed: Aligning YouTube Recommendations Requires Both Controls"
abstract: >-
  Data and analysis code for a 2x2 factorial sock-puppet audit of YouTube's
  explicit feedback controls ('like' and 'not interested') across twelve
  simulated adolescent accounts.
